{"id":"b1f8b060010b2b2b","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed.md","title":"可在正规化前删除的红项非必需","display":"thm-erased-redex-not-needed — 可在正规化前删除的红项非必需","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed","aliases":["56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed"],"display":"thm-erased-redex-not-needed — 可在正规化前删除的红项非必需","depends_on":["[[56-df-needed-redex]]","[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.1 and Proposition 9.2.2; local consequence for orthogonal TRSs","source_printed_pages":"485–486","source_ocr_blocks":[506,507],"source_verification":"概念依据已据本地DjVu提取文本核对；本地形式表示、直接推论与例子的证据范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-erased-redex-not-needed — 可在正规化前删除的红项非必需"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.1 and Proposition 9.2.2; local consequence for orthogonal TRSs"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"485–486"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>506</span><span>507</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"概念依据已据本地DjVu提取文本核对；本地形式表示、直接推论与例子的证据范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a> 的正交系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Needed}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_R\\)</span> 采用该节点的接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne v\">\\(u\\ne v\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(a,u)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(a,u)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；单步残余见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=t\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta))\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta))\\)</span>；路径、拼接与投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li>残余传送的零步与拼接律见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：将具体一步a接上η得到从s到正规形的有限归约。在第一步之前u的残余集是{u}，被收缩的是v≠u，所以首步没有收缩u的残余。首步之后残余为空；有限残余递归及拼接律使其以后始终为空，后续每一步也都没有收缩u的残余。此路径否定needed的全称条件。必须同时保留u≠v和目标可正规化两项假设：被收缩红项自身残余也为空；没有通向正规形的路径则needed条件真空成立。这是依据书中定义与本地残余编码直接证明的推论，并非原书同名定理。</p>\n<p>来源OCR块按本地提取文本的U+001F从1编号；未作机器证明或计算性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-needed-redex","status":"resolved","id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-needed-redex]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-residual-transport-laws","status":"resolved","id":"b2ca2cb031a137a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-needed-redex","status":"resolved","id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的正交系统；$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$ 采用该节点的接口。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$，$u\\ne v$，$\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(a,u)=\\varnothing$；单步残余见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=t$，$\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta))$；路径、拼接与投影见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-residual-transport-laws","status":"resolved","id":"b2ca2cb031a137a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"残余传送的零步与拼接律见 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_R","display":false},{"tex":"a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"u\\ne v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(a,u)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta))","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u).","display":true}],"bytes":2126,"backlinks":[{"id":"d29a2d7a5d02147b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed]] 的非必需判准；$R_2,s_2,u_K,u_a,u_c$ 均由Assertion定义。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1db927c3e4a86c94","a68d6849